## Objective
- Create Google search ads (ad groups, headlines, descriptions, keywords, negative keywords) for SpeakEasy English spoken English course based on landing.md, facts.md, and search_terms.csv
- Save spec as ads.json and build into ads/ folder

## Important Details
- Brand: SpeakEasy English, Lucknow, teaching online since 2020
- Course: Live online spoken English, 60 days, 48 classes, small batches of 8, 7 am & 8 pm batches, Hindi-speaking trainers
- Price: ₹4,999 full course, pay in 2 parts of ₹2,500 via UPI
- Free demo class, 6,500+ learners trained, certificate on completion
- No recorded-only course, no app
- Target: Working professionals & college students who understand English but hesitate to speak
- Negative keywords from search terms: free, pdf, download, app, jobs, teacher, grammar, meaning, home tutor
- allowed_caps includes: UPI, GST, AI, AM, PM

